cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "MuRAT: a multi-resolution seismic attenuation tomography code"
version: 4.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-06
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23170041
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/LucaDeSiena/MuRAT"
keywords:
  - seismology
  - attenuation
  - tomography
  - coda waves
  - MATLAB
abstract: >-
  MuRAT is a MATLAB code for multi-resolution seismic attenuation tomography, including Qc imaging, peak delay and Q inversion.
